  "narrative": {
    "intro": "Federal Express obligated $75.5M in federal contract obligations in FY2027 to date. Federal Express received 66 awards so far in the current fiscal year and the average award size is $1.1M. Federal Express obligations are down 80.3% year over year. Historical obligations by fiscal year show FY22 $309M, FY23 $275M, FY24 $677M, FY25 $582M, FY26 $383M, and FY27 $75.5M. The Department of Veterans Affairs is by far the largest buyer in FY2027 to date at $75.4M. Other buyers with reported obligations in FY2027 to date include the Department of the Treasury, Department of Justice, Federal Maritime Commission, and Court Services and Offender Supervision Agency. Several agencies show zero obligations for the current fiscal year. Current-year totals are partial and reflect fiscal year to date activity rather than a full fiscal year total.",
